              "content": "=Act as an expert Customer Experience Manager and Professional Corporate Communications Specialist. Write a tailored, highly professional email response based on the customer feedback provided below.\n\nDynamic Data from n8n:\n- Customer Name:{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.fullName }} \n- Customer Feedback Message: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.message }}\n- Rating Provided: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.rating }}\n\nOperational Instructions:\n1. Analyze the Feedback Tone: \n   - If the rating is low (1-3 stars) or the feedback is negative/critical, write an empathetic, apologetic, and constructive response. Reassure them that their concern is being looked into and express a strong commitment to improvement.\n   - If the rating is high (4-5 stars) or the feedback is positive, write an enthusiastic, appreciative, and warm response, thanking them for their support and acknowledging their specific praise.\n\nOutput Formatting Constraints (Strict):\n- Start DIRECTLY with the email body (e.g., \"Dear [Customer Name],\" or \"Thank you for sharing your thoughts...\"). Do NOT include a subject line, any \"Here is your email:\" pre-text, or any conversational fluff before the text.\n- Do NOT add any extra sign-off notes, placeholders, or explanations at the end.\n- You must end the email EXACTLY like this (with a single line break before it):\n\nBest Regards,\nMuhammad Sameer"
